                                    <li><a href="#2-plan-the-days-work" class="block rounded py-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted hover:text-accent focus-ring">2. Plan The Day&#039;s Work</a></li>
                                    <li><a href="#3-make-time-for-focused-work" class="block rounded py-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted hover:text-accent focus-ring">3. Make Time For Focused Work</a></li>
                                    <li><a href="#4-set-aside-some-time-offline" class="block rounded py-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted hover:text-accent focus-ring">4. Set Aside Some Time Offline</a></li>
